<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6700178216602082290..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Eeek! An Armed Citizen! </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>13</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2908129030983578448</id><published>2014-05-31T23:43:35.739-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-31T23:43:35.739-06:00</updated><title type='text'>You are asking where the Constitution mentions gun...</title><content type='html'>You are asking where the Constitution mentions guns?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/2908129030983578448'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/2908129030983578448'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1401601415739#c2908129030983578448' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/5421166540771496083'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-589723300"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 31, 2014 at 11:43 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7258045363254459096</id><published>2014-05-23T18:34:01.771-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-23T18:34:01.771-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Why is it some people trust their gov to own weapo...</title><content type='html'>Why is it some people trust their gov to own weapons that can annihilate all life on earth, but then freak out if citizens own a hi-cap semi-auto rifle with 30 rd magazines?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/7258045363254459096'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/7258045363254459096'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400891641771#c7258045363254459096' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/6917957722836978771'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-598580149"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 23, 2014 at 6:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-928851814484288719</id><published>2014-05-23T08:13:05.073-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-23T08:13:05.073-06:00</updated><title type='text'>it is now in the &amp;#39;news&amp;#39; that, since WWII, ...</title><content type='html'>it is now in the &amp;#39;news&amp;#39; that, since WWII, there have been 248 wars, of which the u. s. govt has started 201 of such, with the resultant death of 30 MILLION human beings.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;to give such people as those featured in that article power over all, with a grant of using deadly force when &amp;#39;required&amp;#39;, is an action that defies true description when employing words. the limitations of language become quite obvious when searching for a word, or words, to describe such an action by such people.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the conditioned animals, unable to truly differentiate friend from foe, will become the victims of the foes they view as &amp;#39;friends&amp;#39; and have elevated.  each day brings more &amp;#39;news&amp;#39; as to the true nature of the enforcement class, apparently overlooked by the propagandized/dumbed down &amp;#39;citizenry&amp;#39;. so be it.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;what of those of us who have not signed on to such a deadly pact?  those of us who recognize the deadly nature of the state and its enforcement class?  no answers are calming given the total sellout of the propagandized and dumbed down &amp;#39;citizens&amp;#39; among which we find ourselves.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;the good to all this?  no evil has ever existed forever on this earth, there are obvious chinks in the armor of the beast among us and the entire world has awakened to the true evil that constitutes that which masquerades as our &amp;#39;servant&amp;#39;.  recognizing a problem is the first solution to solving the problem. the remainder of the world now recognizes the problem. the only thing remaining is for we, the people, to recognize the problem, or, at least, a large enough number of us to do so to effect change.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/928851814484288719'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/928851814484288719'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400854385073#c928851814484288719' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-582453510"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 23, 2014 at 8:13 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3480358960270512160</id><published>2014-05-22T10:37:20.847-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-22T10:37:20.847-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;....You really do love your guns don&amp;#39;t y...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;....You really do love your guns don&amp;#39;t you!...&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;No, not really. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s more like we really just hate the idea of anyone telling us &amp;quot;Roll over; Sit; Beg; Down&amp;quot; like Euroweenies have gotten used to doing. And we appreciate having the ability to tell the &amp;#39;powers-that-be&amp;quot; to &amp;quot;Go F*** Yourself&amp;quot; and back it up should it come to it..&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s pretty simple - for those that understand the concept of Liberty, at any rate.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/3480358960270512160'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/3480358960270512160'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400776640847#c3480358960270512160' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/6917957722836978771'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-635731281"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2014 at 10:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3330117481243834923</id><published>2014-05-22T09:12:35.498-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-22T09:12:35.498-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;What an upside-down world it is when EMPLOYE...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;What an upside-down world it is when EMPLOYEES with supposedly limited authority can waylay their fully-authorized sovereign EMPLOYERS for doing what the EMPLOYEE/HIRELING does with allegedly limited, granted authority . . . carry a gun!&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;No, the world is not upside down. It is, however, filled with bullshit. That &amp;quot;employer/employee&amp;quot; relationship never existed. It&amp;#39;s just a bit of propaganda dreamed up by the ruling class to make our slavery more palatable.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We are in a constant state of war because it is in the ruler&amp;#39;s interest to have war.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/3330117481243834923'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/3330117481243834923'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400771555498#c3330117481243834923' title=''/><author><name>Paul Bonneau</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15279129269584372919</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-814412989"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2014 at 9:12 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5421166540771496083</id><published>2014-05-22T00:03:29.357-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-22T00:03:29.357-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Aw shucks where does the Constitution ever mention...</title><content type='html'>Aw shucks where does the Constitution ever mention guns?  Tench Coxe made it quite clear individuals ought to be free to own any weapon they can get their hands on.  Heck the guns that existed when the 2A was framed were nothing compared to modern day guns.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;On the other hand, the U.S. is in perpetual state of war?  I supposed only technically speaking however most roly-poly Americans can go through their lives without paying any notice let alone actually know what it&amp;#39;s like to be in a war torn country.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/5421166540771496083'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/5421166540771496083'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400738609357#c5421166540771496083' title=''/><author><name>Gil</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-70390277"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2014 at 12:03 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-867907443069016875</id><published>2014-05-21T16:22:08.595-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-21T16:22:08.595-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous @ 12:17 PM:&#xa;&#xa;Sounds like you are not in ...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous @ 12:17 PM:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Sounds like you are not in this country. Being an outsider often gives a clearer perspective. Granted. However, the reason the USA is in a constant state of war is that it prints without limit the world&amp;#39;s reserve currency, the dollar. This makes this place the epicenter of global theft and corruption, on a scale the mind can scarcely fathom. The constant wars are against those countries or leaders who think they should be independent of Uncle Sam, and that their national resources belong to them and not to America&amp;#39;s oligarch class. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Yes, we love our guns. And thank God for that, otherwise our lords and masters would have us all microchipped and chained to our workstations. It&amp;#39;s bad enough already, as Mr. Grigg reminds us weekly, but if we were not so heavily armed, there would be no pretense of liberty as there is now, but a frank and overt condition of slavery. Did you see the goons, the servants of Moloch, back down recently in Bunkerville? That was only because they were faced with considerable firepower and the world&amp;#39;s media were watching, and so they decided to leave before things got out of hand. Contrast that with Waco, Texas, where 80-plus women and children were torched alive with incendiary grenades. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Yes, this country is constantly at war. But not only against other countries - it is also at war against its own so-called &amp;quot;citizens.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That&amp;#39;s why we love our guns.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - LG&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;PS: The USA makes Ancient Rome look positively benign. Probably only the Mongol Empire was more vicious. Enjoy the fact that you don&amp;#39;t have to live here.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/867907443069016875'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/867907443069016875'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400710928595#c867907443069016875' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-140406185"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2014 at 4:22 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2749874089020470698</id><published>2014-05-21T14:13:46.798-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-21T14:13:46.798-06:00</updated><title type='text'>We&amp;#39;re in a perpetual state of war because of t...</title><content type='html'>We&amp;#39;re in a perpetual state of war because of the machinations of the people who demand a monopoly on firearms ownership, not because there are some who want to break up that monopoly and promote non-aggression. Just FYI. :-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/2749874089020470698'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/2749874089020470698'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400703226798#c2749874089020470698' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2014 at 2:13 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2575973045690667364</id><published>2014-05-21T12:50:21.634-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-21T12:50:21.634-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thus he suggests that the phrase, “when serving in...</title><content type='html'>Thus he suggests that the phrase, “when serving in the Militia” should be added to the Second Amendment, which would then read: “A well-regulated Militia, being necessary to the security of a free State, the right of the people to keep and bear Arms when serving in the Militia shall not be infringed.”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I find this rather interesting in light of the fact that even our military members are disarmed while on base.  Remember those shooting incidents that have happened on military bases recently?  Only the bad guy was armed, which is how they managed to kill as many as they did.  So even our &amp;quot;militia&amp;quot; as it is seen by our own government aren&amp;#39;t recognized their rights under the second amendment.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/2575973045690667364'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/2575973045690667364'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400698221634#c2575973045690667364' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-636485934"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2014 at 12:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6917957722836978771</id><published>2014-05-21T12:17:27.134-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-21T12:17:27.134-06:00</updated><title type='text'>No wonder the US is in a perpetual state of war. Y...</title><content type='html'>No wonder the US is in a perpetual state of war. You really do love your guns don&amp;#39;t you!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216