uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='21' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_2M4bJPbxsp8/TBb7znel8jI/AAAAAAAAAAw/QzK7MRCVZMw/s1600-R/wraithmovie04.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-180103509"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2014 at 11:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-796956663498339631</id><published>2014-05-21T09:25:10.931-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-21T09:25:10.931-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Did you all see up there in the article what Polic...</title><content type='html'>Did you all see up there in the article what Police Chief Ken James said??? With all those pious morons lined up worshipfully behind him with their silly placards? Cut out the extra words, and this is what you have - in his own words:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;“A gun is an offensive weapon used to intimidate and used to show power. Police officers..... carry a gun in order to do their job.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There it is! The JOB of the police, as defined by their Police Chief, is not &amp;quot;to serve and protect.&amp;quot; No. It is &amp;quot;to intimidate and to show power.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What more do we need to hear?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - LG&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;PS: And if the &amp;quot;show of power&amp;quot; is not sufficiently appreciated by us Mundanes, or if we fail to be sufficiently &amp;quot;intimidated,&amp;quot; then we will be powered and intimidated up to and including Death By Cop. Which is not a crime of murder or a violation of the Constitution, but just an &amp;quot;Officer&amp;quot; doing his &amp;quot;Job.&amp;quot; As defined by the Police Chief Hisself.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Wonderful.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/796956663498339631'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/796956663498339631'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400685910931#c796956663498339631' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1438931946"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2014 at 9:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3750465205392509265</id><published>2014-05-20T17:11:14.921-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-20T17:11:14.921-06:00</updated><title type='text'>What an upside-down world it is when EMPLOYEES wit...</title><content type='html'>What an upside-down world it is when EMPLOYEES with supposedly limited authority can waylay their fully-authorized sovereign EMPLOYERS for doing what the EMPLOYEE/HIRELING does with allegedly limited, granted authority . . . carry a gun!  When does a hirer grant more authority to a hireling than he retains for himself?  Absurd!  It profoundly demonstrates the utterly perverted and mendacious usurpation of the hierarchical relationship between boss and &amp;quot;servant&amp;quot; when that contractual agency involves the State. What a heinously bad joke is the motto &amp;quot;protect and serve&amp;quot;.  It bares the insidious truth that lurks behind the false concept of the &amp;quot;democratic&amp;quot; State and its subordination to the individual.    </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/3750465205392509265'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6700178216602082290/comments/default/3750465205392509265'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html?showComment=1400627474921#c3750465205392509265' title=''/><author><name>rkshanny</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/05/eeek-armed-citizen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6700178216602082290' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6700178216602082290' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1509213986"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 20, 2014 at 5:11 PM"/></entry></feed>